{{PCExclusive}}
'''Entangled Wooden Horse Javelins''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the VIP [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]], only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

{{Cat Info
