|rarity = UR
|version = PC
|name1 = Entangled Wooden Horse Javelins
|name2 = Surprise Trojan Fortress
|image1 = 10909 1.png
|image2 = 10909 2.png
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Surprise Trojan Fortress''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
With their long range, high stats and crowd-controlling abilities, this unit absolutely excels against its' targeted traits. It outranges almost every single Zombie and Metal enemy, aside from a few rare cases like [[Zamelle]] or [[Daboo of the Dead|Daboo]], who are very infrequent. While having slow and knockback may seem to cause the infamous "[[Mizli (Uber Rare Cat)|Mizli]] Syndrome", Zombie or Metal-focused stages tend to not have many backliners. Sadly, this unit can't use its' absolutely nuclear damage against Metal enemies, since it lacks the ability to generate [[Critical Hit]]s.

Make sure to use it in its first form, since it attacks much quicker and thus has more DPS.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Crowd-Controller}}

